{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52982","headline":"扬州崔行军水亭泛舟望月醼集赋诗（幷序） · 独孤及","name":"扬州崔行军水亭泛舟望月醼集赋诗（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明月借秋兴，流光在此池。\n山公顾我厚，酩酊称未疲。\n勿谓嘉会易，但忧离别随。\n饱君醉中德，敢使松心移。\n（见《四部丛刊初编》影清赵怀玉刊本《毘陵集》卷十六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}